 mg 300 mg"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Occasion\nAnytime you need any energy boost\nPre-workout energy & hydration\nPost workout recovery & rehydration\nWhen added to at least 10 fl oz of water"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Recommended Use for Healthy Adults:\nFor pre-workout energy and hydration support: Take 2-6 scoops with at least 10-12 fl oz of water 30 min before training.\nFor post-workout muscle recovery support: Take 2-4 scoops with at least 10-12 fl oz of water after training."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician before using this product if you are taking any medications or are under a physician's care for a medical condition. Not for use by those under the age of 18, women that are pregnant, trying to get pregnant, or nursing, or those what are sensitive to caffeine or beta-alanine."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not for use by those under the age of 18, women that are pregnant, trying to get pregnant, or nursing, or those what are sensitive to caffeine or beta-alanine."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not consume caffeine from other sources while taking this product as too much caffeine may cause nervousness, irritability, sleeplessness, and occasionally rapid heartbeat. Beta-alanine may cause a harmless, temporary tingling or flushing sensation. \nDo not combine with alcohol. Do not exceed 6 scoops within any 4 hour period or 10 scoops within any 24 hour period. Consume as part of a healthy diet and exercise program, and drink at least 100 fl oz of water per day. Exercise may increase your need for fluid intake."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Manufactured in the USA\nThis product contains ingredients of international and domestic origin\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Plus electrolytes\nWatermelon splash\nNaturally and artificially flavored"},{"type":"Formula